  "packageHash": "hYB+6SLCclSTzmC+JkasHwo4ZpEhOdIpI/3hpfChLd6ojGL9fTqbrUMPI9DHOZ9IhrUq1ZWgv3BOadUKw0ZEvQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 12701545,
  "published": "2026-05-07T06:45:00.617Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 — Adds win-arm64 native binaries. ARM64 DLLs (tesseract50.dll, leptonica-1.82.0.dll) are built from Tesseract 5.5.2 + Leptonica 1.87.0 source via vcpkg with a slim overlay-port (libcurl + libarchive disabled), Authenticode-signed by Fieldcure Co., Ltd., and selected at build time by detecting host RID via win-x64 (with AnyCPU// override paths for explicit arch builds). The wrapper hardcodes \"leptonica-1.82.0\" + \"tesseract50\" filenames, so the ARM64 leptonica file is renamed to leptonica-1.82.0.dll and tesseract50.dll's PE import table is patched in-place to reference that name. The x64 path is unchanged (Tesseract 5.0 native, redistributed from upstream Tesseract NuGet 5.2.0). The Tesseract C ABI is additive across 5.0 -> 5.5, so the wrapper's DllImport surface is fully compatible. Build script: scripts/build-tesseract-arm64.ps1. CI verified on windows-11-arm runner.",
